#HELPS
1 ADANUMURAN BANDIT LAIR~
Adanumuran is a bandit cave against the hills by Lake Amaya's northwest shore,
where Dunmer outlaws and wild nix-hounds guard their stolen goods and shelter.
Crates, weapons and stolen loot fill the dark chambers beyond its hidden mouth
including an old skill book and an unusually broad lute.
~
